  "question": "Suppose \\(f\\) is continuously differentiable up to 3rd order and satisfies \\(\\displaystyle\\int_0^1\\{6f(x)+x^3f^{(3)}(x)\\}\\,dx=f''(1)\\). Which of the following must be true?",
